                                    <h1>Shopify vs BigCommerce vs Custom Headless: D2C Ecommerce Platform Comparison 2026</h1>
                                    <p>Ecommerce platform choice is one of the most consequential D2C tech decisions — migration cost + operational complexity + performance + customisation ability + scaling economics all matter for years. Shopify (Plus) + BigCommerce Enterprise + custom headless (Next.js + Shopify Hydrogen / commercetools / Salesforce Commerce Cloud) all viable. Here is the detailed 2026 comparison.</p>
                                    <h2>Platform Overview</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Shopify (Basic + Plus):</strong> Dominant D2C platform — fastest to launch + strong ecosystem + Shopify Plus enterprise features.<br><strong>BigCommerce Enterprise:</strong> Alternative to Shopify Plus + more customisation + no transaction fees + strong B2B features.<br><strong>Custom Headless (Next.js + Shopify Hydrogen / commercetools / Salesforce Commerce Cloud):</strong> Full customisation + performance-optimised + enterprise-scale but requires engineering team.</p>
                                    <h2>Shopify Plus — When It Works Best</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Best for:</strong> D2C brands 5-500 Cr revenue + Shopify ecosystem + faster launch + operational efficiency + established third-party integrations.<br><strong>Advantages:</strong> Fastest launch (weeks vs months) + massive ecosystem + Klaviyo + Recharge + reviews + loyalty apps + strong theme + template ecosystem.<br><strong>Cost:</strong> $2K/month base + transaction fees + apps + custom development.<br><strong>Limits:</strong> Limited checkout customisation (improving) + platform lock-in + transaction fees add up at scale + performance limitations at massive scale.<br><strong>Migration friction:</strong> Moving off Shopify is painful — 6-12 months + significant capital.</p>
                                    <h2>BigCommerce Enterprise — When It Works Best</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Best for:</strong> D2C brands wanting more customisation than Shopify + no transaction fees + strong B2B + omnichannel features.<br><strong>Advantages:</strong> Zero transaction fees + strong customisation + B2B features + open architecture + headless-friendly + omnichannel.<br><strong>Cost:</strong> $2K-15K+/month enterprise pricing + no transaction fees + apps + custom development.<br><strong>Limits:</strong> Smaller ecosystem than Shopify + fewer template options + less mainstream than Shopify.<br><strong>Growth trajectory:</strong> Growing but Shopify remains dominant in D2C.</p>
                                    <h2>Custom Headless — When It Works Best</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Best for:</strong> ₹100+ Cr ARR D2C brands + complex requirements + engineering team + performance-critical + custom checkout + international multi-region.<br><strong>Advantages:</strong> Full customisation + performance-optimised (Core Web Vitals) + no platform limitations + international multi-region + custom checkout + engineering team leverage.<br><strong>Cost:</strong> ₹75 lakh - 3 Cr build cost + ₹20-80 lakh / year ongoing engineering + infrastructure.<br><strong>Limits:</strong> Requires engineering team + longer launch cycle (3-9 months vs weeks) + ongoing maintenance + capital investment.<br><strong>Platform options:</strong> Shopify Hydrogen (Shopify-adjacent headless), commercetools + Salesforce Commerce Cloud (fully independent), custom Next.js + Node.js + Postgres (fully custom).</p>
                                    <h2>Decision Framework by Revenue Stage</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Early stage (0-15 Cr revenue):</strong> Shopify Basic + Shopify Plus. Fast launch + ecosystem + focus on growth vs tech infrastructure.<br><strong>Growth stage (15-100 Cr revenue):</strong> Shopify Plus + BigCommerce Enterprise. Established platform + customisation via apps + third-party integrations.<br><strong>Scaling (100-300 Cr revenue):</strong> Shopify Plus / BigCommerce or consider Shopify Hydrogen (Shopify-adjacent headless).<br><strong>Enterprise (300+ Cr revenue):</strong> Consider full custom headless (Salesforce Commerce Cloud / commercetools / custom Next.js) for performance + customisation + international expansion.<br><strong>Global multi-region enterprise:</strong> Custom headless typically wins for multi-currency + multi-language + regional customisation.</p>
                                    <h2>Migration Cost + Complexity</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Shopify → BigCommerce:</strong> 3-6 months + ₹15-40 lakh migration cost.<br><strong>Shopify → Custom Headless:</strong> 6-12 months + ₹75 lakh - 3 Cr migration.<br><strong>BigCommerce → Custom Headless:</strong> 4-9 months + ₹50 lakh - 2 Cr.<br><strong>Custom → Shopify:</strong> 3-6 months (downgrade rare but possible).<br>Migration cost + operational risk significant — choose carefully + commit 3-5+ years minimum.</p>
                                    <h2>Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) at Scale</h2>
                                    <p>At ₹100 Cr revenue D2C brand:<br><strong>Shopify Plus:</strong> ₹40-80 lakh / year (base + transaction fees + apps + custom dev).<br><strong>BigCommerce Enterprise:</strong> ₹35-70 lakh / year (base + apps + custom dev + no transaction fees).<br><strong>Custom Headless:</strong> ₹80 lakh - 2 Cr / year (engineering team + infrastructure + ongoing development).<br>TCO scales differently — headless higher fixed cost + lower per-transaction cost at massive scale.</p>

