                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Should new D2C brands start on Shopify?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for 95% of brands — fastest launch + ecosystem + focus on growth. Custom headless only if specific reasons (complex requirements + engineering team + scale).</p>
                                        <h3>When should I move from Shopify Plus to headless?</h3>
                                        <p>Typically at ₹100+ Cr ARR with specific reasons (multi-region + custom checkout + performance-critical + engineering team). Below that, Shopify Plus usually sufficient.</p>
                                        <h3>BigCommerce vs Shopify Plus?</h3>
                                        <p>Similar capability. BigCommerce zero transaction fees + more customisation. Shopify Plus larger ecosystem. Choose by ecosystem preference + transaction fee sensitivity.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest platform selection mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Migrating platforms too early. Migration is expensive + operationally risky. Wait until current platform materially blocks growth.</p>
